QUES1. Create a personal portfolio homepage using HTML and CSS.
Requirements:
● The header should contain your name and navigation links (Home, About, Contact).
● Use position: fixed for the header so it stays at the top when scrolling.
● The main section should have a short bio paragraph and a profile image.
● Use different CSS units (px, em, %, vh, rem) across elements.
● Use custom background color and text color combinations that maintain contrast.
● The footer should always stay at the bottom of the page (use flexbox or positioning).

Code:
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Task 1 - Personal Portfolio</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0f172a;
            --bg-secondary: #1e293b;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --accent-blue: #38bdf8;
            --accent-purple: #a78bfa;
            --btn-hover: #0284c7;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .navbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4.5rem;
            background-color: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 4%;
            z-index: 1000;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .accent-text {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .nav-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .portfolio-container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-top: 4.5rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .hero-section {
            width: 85%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            min-height: 75vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 4rem;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }

        .hero-content {
            flex: 1.2;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-purple));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .bio-text {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            max-width: 550px;
        }

        .cta-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.85em 2em;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--accent-blue);
            color: #000;
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-blue);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: var(--btn-hover);
            border-color: var(--btn-hover);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-blue);
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .hero-image-wrapper {
            flex: 0.8;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .profile-image {
            width: 280px;
            height: 280px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease, box-shadow 0.5s ease;
        }

        .profile-image:hover {
            transform: rotate(3deg) scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
        }

        .footer {
            background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        @media (max-width: 968px) {
            .hero-section {
                flex-direction: column-reverse;
                text-align: center;
                gap: 2rem;
                padding: 4rem 0 2rem 0;
            }
            
            .hero-content {
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }
            
            .bio-text {
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }
            
            .profile-image {
                width: 220px;
                height: 220px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">
            <span class="accent-text">&lt;</span>Shailly<span class="accent-text">/&gt;</span>
